<view class="page privacy-page">
  <section-header title="隐私与服务说明" icon="/assets/icons/privacy-active.png" />
  <view class="privacy-list">
    <view class="privacy-row">
      <view class="icon-chip privacy-icon">
        <image src="/assets/icons/privacy-active.png" mode="aspectFit" />
      </view>
      <view class="privacy-body">
        <text class="privacy-title">我们收集什么</text>
        <text class="privacy-text">仅在你使用记录、提醒、反馈等功能时保存必要信息。手机号等信息仅在你主动授权或填写时使用。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="privacy-row">
      <view class="icon-chip privacy-icon">
        <image src="/assets/icons/check-active.png" mode="aspectFit" />
      </view>
      <view class="privacy-body">
        <text class="privacy-title">服务边界</text>
        <text class="privacy-text">本小程序用于健康信息记录、复查提醒和就诊前问题整理，具体健康问题请前往线下正规机构咨询。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="privacy-row">
      <view class="icon-chip privacy-icon">
        <image src="/assets/icons/questions-active.png" mode="aspectFit" />
      </view>
      <view class="privacy-body">
        <text class="privacy-title">联系我们</text>
        <text class="privacy-text">如需反馈问题，可在比赛演示环境中联系项目开发者。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
